				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Use em-quad spacing in README heading\n\nReplace the regular space between the \"Wind\" heading text and the wind emoji with the em-quad HTML entity (&#x2001;) for consistent typographic spacing.\n\nThis aligns with the project convention of em-quad spacing between text and emoji in README headings across all components.",
			"SHA": "a65e8dc6c3427a3c4c8945b0a877249b2876550e"
